      "title": "UNT Faculty",
      "description": "Search Page - UNT Faculty Home Faculty UNT UNTHSC UNT Dallas Staff UNT System Admin UNT UNTHSC UNT Dallas Other Opportunities Student Workers Student Workers UNT All Adjunct Faculty View All System Jobs My Settings Applicant Login Internal Employee Job Postings Careers Home Notice of Intent to Hire Benefits Locations Austin Dallas Denton Fort Worth Frisco Home Faculty UNT UNTHSC UNT Dallas Staff UNT System Admin UNT UNTHSC UNT Dallas Other Opportunities Student Workers Student Workers UNT All Adjunct Faculty View All System Jobs My Settings Applicant Login Kiosk mode UNT Faculty Skip to jobs search results Clear Filters Workplace Type Workplace Type 1 filter options found Workplace Type On Site (7 items) 7 Category Search categories 5 filter options found Category Faculty - Engineering (1 items) 1 Faculty - Information Sciences (1 items) 1 Faculty - Liberal Arts/Social Sciences (2 items) 2 Faculty - Libraries (1 items) 1 Faculty - Science (3 items) 3 Department Search departments 1 filter options found Department UNT-Provost (7 items) 7 Employment Type Search employment types 1 filter options found Employment Type Faculty (7 items) 7 City Search cities 1 filter options found City Denton (7 items) 7 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Lecturer (Continuing): Political Theory and American Politics On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Liberal Arts/Social Sciences Faculty This role is expected to teach PSCI 2305 - US Political Behavior and Policy and PSCI 2306 - US and Texas Constitutions and Institutions classes which are our core undergraduate American politics courses. Read more Assistant Professor of Semiconductors On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Science Faculty The Department of Physics invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant Professor. The candidate's research should be in the area of Semiconductors (experimental). Read more Assistant/Associate Professor of Biophysics On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Science Faculty The Department of Physics at the University of North Texas (UNT) invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant Professor or Associate Professor level. The candidate's research should be in the area of Biophysics (experimental). Read more Associate/Assistant Professor of Cancer Biology On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Science Faculty The Department of Biological Sciences at the University of North Texas invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant or Associate Professor level in the area of Cancer Biology. Preference will be given to applicants with research interests in the areas of physiology and molecular biology of cancer, or development and application of immunotherapy methods for cancer treatment. Read more Lecturer of Political Science and International Studies On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Liberal Arts/Social Sciences Faculty The faculty member will be expected to teach INST 2100 and advanced courses in political science and international studies, including courses in international security, national security, and area studies. with a preference for East Asian countries. Read more Associate Clinical Professor: Electrical Engineering On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Engineering Faculty The Department of Electrical Engineering seeks qualified individuals for its clinical associate professor. The position is expected to teach courses in both undergraduate and graduate level in electrical engineering. Read more Lecturer of Health Informatics and Health Librarianship On Site Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Information Sciences Faculty - Libraries Faculty The Department of Information Science invites applications for a lecturer position in Health Informatics and Health Librarianship. We are seeking excellent candidates with a background in current or emerging areas of health informatics and health librarianship, especially with a focus on artificial intelligence. Read more Displaying all 7 entries 1155 Union Circle #311277, Denton, Tx 76203-5017 Phone: 855.878.7650 (option #2) HRemployment@untsystem.edu Quick Links Home View All System Jobs My Settings Applicant Login Equal Employment Opportunity | Notice of Nondiscrimination | Title IX | Workplace Posters Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept"
