 Postdoctoral Research (4 items) 4 Research Administration (10 items) 10 Research Support - Laboratory/Non-Laboratory (8 items) 8 Student Finance/Registrar (9 items) 9 Student Services/Student Affairs (44 items) 44 UNT Denton Health and Wellness (2 items) 2 Willed Body Program (UNT Health Only) (1 items) 1 Department Search departments 24 filter options found Department DAL-Academic Aff & Stdnt Success (2 items) 2 DAL-Budget & Finance (1 items) 1 DAL-Enrollment Mgmt & Student Aff (1 items) 1 DAL-Office of the President (0 items) 0 DAL-Operations (3 items) 3 DAL-University Advancement (2 items) 2 HSC-Div of Rsrch & Innovation (7 items) 7 HSC-Finance (2 items) 2 HSC-Health Systems (5 items) 5 HSC-Operations & Business Mgmt (8 items) 8 HSC-Provost & Exec VP (9 items) 9 SYS-Finance & Admin (1 items) 1 SYS-Human Resources (4 items) 4 SYS-Information Technology (4 items) 4 SYS-Sys Facilities Plan & Constr (1 items) 1 UNT-Advancement (4 items) 4 UNT-Athletics (3 items) 3 UNT-Enrollment Management (22 items) 22 UNT-Information Technology (4 items) 4 UNT-Provost (44 items) 44 UNT-Research & Innovation (8 items) 8 UNT-Strategic Educational Alliance (1 items) 1 UNT-Student Affairs (35 items) 35 UNT-VP Finance & Admin (12 items) 12 Employment Type Search employment types 5 filter options found Employment Type Adjunct (0 items) 0 Faculty (0 items) 0 Hourly (0 items) 0 Staff (183 items) 183 Student (0 items) 0 City Search cities 5 filter options found City Dallas (8 items) 8 Denton (141 items) 141 Downtown Dallas (1 items) 1 Fort Worth (33 items) 33 Frisco (0 items) 0 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Compensation and Performance Management Analyst Denton, Texas, United States SYS-Human Resources Human Resources Staff The Compensation and Performance Management Analyst provides direct support in the administration of compensation and performance management policies and procedures. The incumbent in this position works with a variety of stakeholders across UNT System institutions to resolve basic compensation and performance evaluation system issues. This is a professional role responsible for supporting compensation and performance management strategy within the UNT System and its constituent institutions. Read more Associate Vice President of Financial Planning, Analysis, Strategy Dallas, Texas, United States DAL-Budget & Finance Executive Administration Staff The Associate Vice President of Financial Planning, Analysis Strategy (AVP) is a fulltime administrative position that serves as the primary support and advisor to the Chief Financial Officer (CFO) in all finance and administrative matters, resource allocation, and in University strategy development, execution, and evaluation. The AVP oversees the Budget Office, Sponsored Projects, Accounting Reporting, Student Business Services, Property Management, and Central Receiving. Read more Board Professional and Office Manager Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Advancement Advancement/Development Staff The Board Professional and Office Manager is a full-time professional support position for the Foundation’s President and Chief Executive Officer (CEO), the UNT Foundation office, and the Foundation Board of Directors.  This full-time, professional staff provides specialized administrative, organizational and communication support on a daily basis.  This person works closely with other Foundation and University staff and with the Board of Directors of the Foundation and reports directly to the CEO. Read more Transportation Attendant Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Police Department/Public Safety Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Parking & Transport Attendant within the University of North Texas Parking and Transportation Services department supports campus mobility, parking rules enforcement, and safe transit operations. Read more Non-Student Hourly Booth Attendant Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Police Department/Public Safety Student Services/Student Affairs Staff The Booth Attendant serves as a primary point of contact for individuals visiting the University of North Texas (UNT) and plays an important role as an ambassador for the university. This position provides exceptional customer service to students, faculty, staff, visitors, parents, university officials, and community members while assisting with parking-related needs and questions. Read more Hourly Upward Bound Saturday Reading teacher Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff UNT Upward Bound is seeking a dedicated and enthusiastic READING teacher to provide reading and literacy instruction to high school students during our Saturday academic sessions. Read more Administrative Coordinator Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Staff This position provides administrative support to the department chair and academic department of over 20 regular faculty plus doctoral students and adjuncts. Major duties include scheduling the department's semester class schedule through careful coordination with the faculty and chair; managing departmental budgets and faculty expenses, processing salaried and hourly payroll; facilitating employee onboarding and off boarding processes, procuring goods/services via purchasing card and requisitions; securing classrooms and transmitting changes to Registrar; facilitating faculty and staff recruitment by managing postings and applicants, scheduling video and campus interviews, arranging travel; and supporting student organization events. Read more Senior Student Services Coordinator Fort Worth, Texas, United States HSC-Provost & Exec VP Administrative/Office Support Staff This position serves as a high level case management position for both Care Team and Student Conduct. As it specifically relates to student conduct, this position is responsible for the investigation and adjudication of student conduct cases, which includes high level decision making such as assigning suspensions and expulsions. Additionally, this position maintains on-call responsibilities for responding to student emergencies. Finally, this position assists in prevention and education programming responsibilities related to Care Team and Conduct topics. Read more Postdoctoral Research Associate - Skellam Lab Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Postdoctoral Research Staff The Skellam lab at the University of North Texas is seeking a highly motivated and determined Postdoctoral Research Associate with experience in the isolation and structural elucidation of natural products from complex crude extracts. Read more Student Finance Service Specialist Fort Worth, Texas, United States HSC-Finance Financial Aid Staff This position is responsible for accurately processing student finance transactions and processes daily cash receipts for the institution. This includes maintaining accounting records and preparation of financial reports. Work in collaboration with other administrative departments. Provide guidance regarding student and department accounts. Delivers exceptional customer service to students and their parent. Conduct research and provide reports related to reconciliation issues. Read more Systems Integration Architect Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Information Technology Information Technology Staff This position is responsible for ownership of day today technical management including the designing, procuring, installing and maintaining of all components (digital, communications and other) in setting up large, complex buildings and rooms within the university. This position ensures the system and component specific choices meet the scalability and operational effectiveness needs of UNT. Read more Senior Systems Integration Architect Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Information Technology Information Technology Staff This position would support the purpose of solidifying the function of Integrated Systems and Development and Operations for UNT (DevOps). This job includes exercising a working knowledge of Development and Operations best practices for a team that utilizes tools such as application development (multi platform), web development, coding as infrastructure, SQL server and database bound applications, automation as operations. The primary focus of this manager will be Development. Read more Cross Functional IT Support Coordinator Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Information Technology Administrative/Office Support Information Technology Staff This position provides high level technical support for Faculty, Staff, Students, and Guests of UNT. Duties include maintaining, troubleshooting, and repairing A/V systems, digital signage systems, student/lab computers; responding to user requests for technology assistance, training, and support; providing technology support for campus events; assisting with other departmental services such as checking out equipment, installing software, responding to tickets, etc. Read more Evening Facility Coordinator Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff This position is responsible for assisting with the planning, conducting, managing, staffing and equipping of the Informal Recreation program within Recreational Sports. Additionally, this position supervises the evening operations in the Pohl Recreation Center and other auxiliary facilities. Read more Internship Specialist Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff The Career Center Department at the University of North Texas is seeking to hire an Internship Coordinator to join our team. Position is responsible for organizing and managing internship programs and events for assigned colleges; provide internship programming to students interested in working as an intern, and work with faculty and staff in the colleges to provide support for their internship programs within their colleges; work with academic counselors on internship procedures, ensure that student internships are meeting departmental requirements and receiving credit for their internship; work with Internship Team to grow and expand Career Treks Job Shadowing program, work with students through classes, student organizations and individually to promote the services as they seek to make internship decisions; reach out to companies that recruit students from their assigned colleges and strengthen/start a recruiting relationship with companies; ensure that all activities of the office are assessed and reported. Read more Budget Officer Denton, Texas, United States SYS-Information Technology Accounting/Finance/Budget/Payroll Information Technology Staff This position provides budgetary, financial, and analytical support to the UNT System Information Technology organization. The position assists in the development, monitoring, and forecasting of operating and capital budgets; prepares financial analyses and reports; and supports strategic decision-making by the Chief Information Officer and IT leadership team. The position reports to the Senior Director of IT Finance and Vendor Management and serves as a key resource for financial planning, budget management, and technology investment analysis. Read more Financial Aid Counselor Fort Worth, Texas, United States HSC-Provost & Exec VP Administrative/Office Support Financial Aid Staff Evaluates and analyzes financial information submitted by applicants to determine eligibility for financial assistance and determines type and amount of aid to be awarded in accordance with established federal and university standards and guidelines. Coordinates and administers assigned financial aid programs such as the federal work study program, Pell/SEOG, and state grants. Read more Sr Grant & Contract Acct Anlst Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Research & Innovation Administrative/Office Support Research Administration Staff The Sr Grants & Contracts Accounting Analyst position in the Grants & Contracts Administration unit (Post-Award team) is responsible for administering highly complex research grant awards and budgets to maintain fiscal compliance and to minimize University liability and legal/financial risk campus-wide. The position reviews and sets up highly complex awards, monitors them, prepares invoices, financial reports and performs the award close-out. Prepares documents for requests for information and audits. Interpret sponsor guidelines/stay abreast of federal/state policy changes for 100+ external sponsors with varying legal/financial requirements. Vital campus expert, mitigate risk campus-wide in high-risk areas. Develop/deliver complex campus-wide training, develop and implement internal reporting and analysis tools. Develop policies/internal controls. Manage special projects. Read more Student Services Coordinator (Center for Academic Performance) Fort Worth, Texas, United States HSC-Provost & Exec VP Administrative/Office Support Staff The Writing Coordinator in the Center for Academic Performance is a hybrid position, working both on campus and remotely to aid in the support of students by providing academic writing and presentation support. This position will meet individually with students, both in person and via online meeting platforms, to assess and provide feedback regarding writing skills. They will work closely with other departments and academic programs to integrate writing skills with curriculum. They will provide students with presentations and workshops focused on the enhancement of writing skills. When on campus, the Writing Coordinator does work out of a shared office space, with access to space to meet privately with students. Read more Postdoctoral Research Associate - The Horn Lab within the Department of Biological Sciences and BioDiscovery Institute (BDI). Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Postdoctoral Research Staff The Horn Laboratory in The BioDiscovery Institute and Department of Biological Sciences at the University of North Texas is seeking to hire a highly motivated Postdoctoral Research Associate to join our team. Our lab broadly focuses on characterizing molecular processes and engineering lipid-based bioproducts in plant systems Read more Director of Communications, Marketing and Public Relations Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Advertising/Marketing Staff The College of Visual Arts and Design (CVAD) at the University of North Texas (UNT) is seeking a Director of Communications, Marketing and Public Relations to provide strategic leadership for college-level marketing, communications, and public relations. The Director develops and implements an integrated communications strategy that advances the college’s priorities, strengthens its visibility and reputation, and supports student recruitment, engagement, advancement, and community outreach.\nThe Director oversees CVAD communications across multiple platforms and formats, including the college website, social media, newsletters, press releases, advertising, donor and recruitment materials, publications, short-form video, and other print and digital content. The position creates and edits clear, compelling, and audience-focused communications and identifies opportunities to share the accomplishments and impact of CVAD students, faculty, staff, alumni, programs, and partners.\nWorking closely with UNT’s University Brand Strategy and Communications (UBSC), the Director ensures that CVAD communications align with university branding, communication standards, institutional priorities, and applicable policies. The position requires exceptional writing, editing, proofreading, project-management, and organizational skills, as well as the ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines.\nThe Director is responsible for ensuring that web, digital, print, and multimedia communications meet institutional policies and accessibility requirements, including ADA compliance. Additional responsibilities include cultivating media and campus relationships, researching marketing opportunities and best practices, supporting major college events and initiatives, and supervising student employees. Read more Student Media Coordinator Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Staff It is responsible for supporting multiple student media groups, including the Debate Team, Comm Future Pros, DCTV, Hatch, KNTU, NT Daily, NTTV, and Swoop. This position will perform or assist with a variety of administrative including (1) payroll processes; (2) purchases for student meetings and events; (3) requisition and invoice management; (4) reserve rooms for student media meetings; (5) working with faculty advisors and staff managers of various student media areas; (6) other duties as may be assigned. Read more Digital Accessibility Specialist Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff The Digital Accessibility Specialist within the Office of Disability Access is a student-, faculty-, and staff-facing position focused on advancing digital accessibility across the University of North Texas. The Digital Accessibility Specialist works directly with students with disabilities and faculty to identify, troubleshoot, and resolve digital accessibility barriers that may impact a student’s access to course materials, instructional technologies, or participation in the academic experience. Read more UNT Retail Dining Services, Union Burger- Food Service Specialist Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Food Services/Hospitality Staff The Food Service Specialist at Union Burger within UNT Retail Dining Services is responsible for delivering high-quality food and exceptional customer service in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment. This position supports daily operations by preparing and serving menu items, maintaining food safety and sanitation standards, and ensuring a clean and welcoming dining area for students, faculty, staff, and guests. Read more Strategic Communications Coordinator Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Advancement Advancement/Development Staff The Strategic Communications Coordinator supports the successful execution of communications initiatives across the Division of University Advancement by coordinating projects, maintaining departmental workflows, and helping ensure strategic priorities move efficiently from planning through completion. Read more UNT Retail Dining Services, Union Burger - Food Service Supervisor Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Food Services/Hospitality Staff The Food Service Supervisor for Union Burger at the University of North Texas -Retail Dining Services is responsible for overseeing daily restaurant operations, ensuring exceptional customer service, and maintaining high standards of food quality, safety, and cleanliness. This role provides hands-on leadership to team members, supports staff training and development, and ensures efficient workflow during all service periods. Read more Sr Student & Pgrm Coordinator Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Research Administration Staff The position coordinates various activities to recruit, retain, mentor students to support the mission and strategic plan of the academic program. Responsible for managing the daily operations of the program, including mass communications, publications, research and interacting with students and potential students. Supervises all administrative tasks related to strategic planning, travel logistics, and recruiting. This position is essential to providing high quality coaching and training, while nurturing the development of students. Read more ERP System Administrator II Denton, Texas, United States SYS-Information Technology Information Technology Staff The IT Shared Services Department at the University of North Texas is seeking to hire an ERP Systems Administrator II to join our team. This position performs moderately complex (journeylevel) ERP client/server enterprise systems administrator work. Work involves analyzing user requirements, procedures, and problems to automate processing or to improve existing systems. May train others. Works under general supervision with limited latitude for the use of initiative and independent judgment. Read more Graphic Design Specialist Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Advertising/Marketing Staff This position is responsible for the professional, artistic design and production of impactful graphics and media content for communications and marketing materials of the College of Music, both print and digital. This work supports our efforts to enhance the Colleges reputation, build audiences for our concerts and events, and support the recruitment of our students, faculty, and staff. Read more Asst Dir Registrar Processing Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Enrollment Management Student Finance/Registrar Staff This position is responsible for managing and directing daily operations of Reporting, Systems, and Testing, and overseeing process continuity for the maintenance and coordination of student, academic and curricular records to support enrollment and retention. Contributes to the Office of the Registrar efforts to promote productivity, collaboration, and coordination within and between all sections of the office and functions as an escalation point for highly complex issues including handling advanced exceptions. This role requires direct interaction with students, former students, faculty, and staff, processing data-driven requests, developing training and ensuring compliance with a range of institutional, state, and federal regulations. This position requires a detail driven critical thinker who thrives in a fast-paced environment, is technically proficient in diverse software platforms and understands interdependencies. This position requires discernment and problem-solving to review escalations and complex and collaborative processes. Promotes and generates collaboration across teams to achieve a collective outcome and creates a unified team that get results optimizing outcomes and impact that directly affects enrollment and retention. Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 183 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1901 Main St, Dallas, Tx 75201 Phone: 855.878.7650 (option #2) HRemployment@untsystem.edu Quick Links Home View All System Jobs My Settings Applicant Login Equal Employment Opportunity | Notice of Nondiscrimination | Title IX | Workplace Posters Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept"
