    "https://careercenter.unt.edu/": {
      "title": "Your Future Starts Here",
      "description": "Home |  University of North Texas Skip to main content close Search... Search Search Options Search This Site Search All of UNT University of North Texas MYUNT CANVAS STUDENT EMAIL UNT DIRECTORY SEARCH Division of Student Affairs Career Center About Back About Career Center Staff Wilson Jones Career Center Students Back Students Appointments On-Campus Employment Internship Information Career Readiness Connect with Employers Student Resources Employers Back Employers Recruiting at UNT Employer Advisory Board Alumni Faculty/Staff Back Faculty/Staff On-Campus Employment Partner with Us Faculty/Staff Resources Handshake Menu About Back About Career Center Staff Wilson Jones Career Center Students Back Students Appointments On-Campus Employment Internship Information Career Readiness Connect with Employers Student Resources Employers Back Employers Recruiting at UNT Employer Advisory Board Alumni Faculty/Staff Back Faculty/Staff On-Campus Employment Partner with Us Faculty/Staff Resources Handshake Search: Search Type THIS SITE ALL of UNT Search Search Quicklinks: MyUNT CANVAS STUDENT EMAIL UNT DIRECTORY Your Future Starts Here Whether you’re still figuring out what you want to do or ready to land your next opportunity,\n                           the UNT Career Center is here to help you every step of the way. We support you from\n                           your first semester through graduation and beyond. No matter your major or career\n                           goals, you don’t have to navigate the future alone. Resources Record My Internship Report Post-Graduation Plans Find a Job Meet with a Career Coach Discover Your Path. Launch Your Career. UNT's Career Center is where students turn curiosity into direction, experience into\n                        opportunity and goals into what’s next. We partner with students, employers and alumni\n                        to build meaningful career pathways that last long after graduation. No matter where\n                        you are in your journey, we’re here to help you move forward with confidence and support\n                        you every step of the way. We help you discover paths that align with your interests\n                        and strengths, build career‑ready skills through resumes, interviewing and offer negotiation,\n                        and connect with employers who are looking for your talent. Students Work with a career coach in your college and gain access to campus jobs, internships\n                                 and career readiness support. Employers We connect employers with motivated, career‑ready students and alumni prepared to\n                                 contribute from day one. Alumni Alumni benefit from ongoing career coaching, professional development and networking\n                                 opportunities. Faculty & Staff Together with faculty and staff, we support student success through on‑campus employment\n                                 and career‑building experiences. Career Services that Work for You \"Before I began my internship search, I had an initial meeting with the Career Center\n                                    where they introduced me to different sites and resources. When I was ready to start\n                                    applying, I reviewed their list of recommended tools. The Career Center also helped\n                                    me refine my résumé, which made a big difference in my applications.\" -- Emily H., College of Visual Arts and Design Internship with Art Bridges Foundation More Events Career Center Service Hours Day Regular Hours Drop-In Hours M Monday 8:00am - 5:00pm 9:00am - 1:00pm T Tuesday 8:00am - 5:00pm 1:00pm - 5:00pm W Wednesday 8:00am - 5:00pm 10:00am - 4:00pm Th Thursday 8:00am - 5:00pm 1:00pm - 5:00pm F Friday 8:00am - 5:00pm 10:00am - 4:00pm Connect With the Career Center Regular Hours Appointments by phone, in-person, email and Zoom Students and Recent Graduates: Navigate Experienced Alumni: Handshake Drop-Ins No appointment needed Phone or Video: Navigate In-person: Sage Hall , Room 202 The UNT Career Center encourages persons with disabilities to participate in our events and meet with our\n            staff. If you anticipate needing an accommodation or have questions about accessibility,\n            please call 940-565-2105 in advance of the event or your visit. Career Center Sage Hall, Suite 202 1167 Union Circle Denton, TX 76201 career.center@unt.edu (940) 565-2105 Follow Us Apply now! Take a tour Get more info MyUNT Canvas Student Email UNT Directory Campus Map Jobs at UNT Accessibility University of North Texas. All Rights Reserved. Disclaimer Notice of Non-Discrimination Privacy Electronic Accessibility Required Links UNT Home ©"
    },
