nd safe transit operations. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Police Department/Public Safety Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Non-Student Work Control Assistant - Part Time This position is responsible for functioning as a contact between Facilities and its customers, and for assisting other employees in managing work orders for the campus. This position operates the computerized Maintenance Management System (WebTMA) daily to receive and process service requests from UNT customers. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Administrative/Office Support Hourly Read more Non-Student Hourly Booth Attendant The Booth Attendant serves as a primary point of contact for individuals visiting the University of North Texas (UNT) and plays an important role as an ambassador for the university. This position provides exceptional customer service to students, faculty, staff, visitors, parents, university officials, and community members while assisting with parking-related needs and questions. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Police Department/Public Safety Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Hourly Upward Bound Saturday Reading teacher UNT Upward Bound is seeking a dedicated and enthusiastic READING teacher to provide reading and literacy instruction to high school students during our Saturday academic sessions. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Administrative Coordinator This position provides administrative support to the department chair and academic department of over 20 regular faculty plus doctoral students and adjuncts. Major duties include scheduling the department's semester class schedule through careful coordination with the faculty and chair; managing departmental budgets and faculty expenses, processing salaried and hourly payroll; facilitating employee onboarding and off boarding processes, proc