ss (2 items) 2 Department Search departments 9 filter options found Department UNT-Advancement (4 items) 4 UNT-Athletics (3 items) 3 UNT-Enrollment Management (22 items) 22 UNT-Information Technology (4 items) 4 UNT-Provost (124 items) 124 UNT-Research & Innovation (8 items) 8 UNT-Strategic Educational Alliance (2 items) 2 UNT-Student Affairs (39 items) 39 UNT-VP Finance & Admin (14 items) 14 Employment Type Search employment types 4 filter options found Employment Type Adjunct (66 items) 66 Faculty (7 items) 7 Hourly (14 items) 14 Staff (133 items) 133 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Lecturer (Continuing): Political Theory and American Politics This role is expected to teach PSCI 2305 - US Political Behavior and Policy and PSCI 2306 - US and Texas Constitutions and Institutions classes which are our core undergraduate American politics courses. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Liberal Arts/Social Sciences Faculty Read more Non-student Hourly - Facilities Building Information Management Modeler The BIM Modeler will support the Building Information Management team's work as the campus authority on building information. This position will be responsible for assisting in the on-going generation of BIM-based record floor plans for all buildings across the UNT campus. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Facilities/Construction Management Hourly Read more Part Time Academic Advisor This position serves as a full-time academic advisor for the College of Liberal Arts and Social Sciences. Advisors will work to promote student success, progression, and timely graduation. They also keep student records up to date, present at informational workshops for students and assist with events such as Preview Day and Commencement. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Academic Advising Student Services/Student Affairs Hourly Read more Hourly TRIO Talent Search at HEB ISD Ambassador The University of North Texas TRIO Talent Search Program serving Hurst-Euless-Bedford ISD is seeking a part-time Ambassador to support middle school students as they prepare for high school and postsecondary education. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Hourly Read more Board Professional and Office Manager The Board Professional and Office Manager is a full-time professional support position for the Foundation’s President and Chief Executive Officer (CEO), the UNT Foundation office, and the Foundation Board of Directors.  This full-time, professional staff provides specialized administrative, organizational and communication support on a daily basis.  This person works closely with other Foundation and University staff and with the Board of Directors of the Foundation and reports directly to the CEO. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Advancement Advancement/Development Staff Read more Assistant Professor of Semiconductors The Department of Physics invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant Professor. The candidate's research should be in the area of Semiconductors (experimental). Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Science Faculty Read more Assistant/Associate Professor of Biophysics The Department of Physics at the University of North Texas (UNT) invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant Professor or Associate Professor level. The candidate's research should be in the area of Biophysics (experimental). Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Science Faculty Read more Associate/Assistant Professor of Cancer Biology The Department of Biological Sciences at the University of North Texas invites applications for a tenure-track faculty position at the Assistant or Associate Professor level in the area of Cancer Biology. Preference will be given to applicants with research interests in the areas of physiology and molecular biology of cancer, or development and application of immunotherapy methods for cancer treatment. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Science Faculty Read more Transportation Attendant Parking & Transport Attendant within the University of North Texas Parking and Transportation Services department supports campus mobility, parking rules enforcement, and safe transit operations. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Police Department/Public Safety Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Non-Student Work Control Assistant - Part Time This position is responsible for functioning as a contact between Facilities and its customers, and for assisting other employees in managing work orders for the campus. This position operates the computerized Maintenance Management System (WebTMA) daily to receive and process service requests from UNT customers. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Administrative/Office Support Hourly Read more Non-Student Hourly Booth Attendant The Booth Attendant serves as a primary point of contact for individuals visiting the University of North Texas (UNT) and plays an important role as an ambassador for the university. This position provides exceptional customer service to students, faculty, staff, visitors, parents, university officials, and community members while assisting with parking-related needs and questions. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-VP Finance & Admin Police Department/Public Safety Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Hourly Upward Bound Saturday Reading teacher UNT Upward Bound is seeking a dedicated and enthusiastic READING teacher to provide reading and literacy instruction to high school students during our Saturday academic sessions. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Administrative Coordinator This position provides administrative support to the department chair and academic department of over 20 regular faculty plus doctoral students and adjuncts. Major duties include scheduling the department's semester class schedule through careful coordination with the faculty and chair; managing departmental budgets and faculty expenses, processing salaried and hourly payroll; facilitating employee onboarding and off boarding processes, procuring goods/services via purchasing card and requisitions; securing classrooms and transmitting changes to Registrar; facilitating faculty and staff recruitment by managing postings and applicants, scheduling video and campus interviews, arranging travel; and supporting student organization events. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Staff Read more Postdoctoral Research Associate - Skellam Lab The Skellam lab at the University of North Texas is seeking a highly motivated and determined Postdoctoral Research Associate with experience in the isolation and structural elucidation of natural products from complex crude extracts. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Postdoctoral Research Staff Read more Systems Integration Architect This position is responsible for ownership of day today technical management including the designing, procuring, installing and maintaining of all components (digital, communications and other) in setting up large, complex buildings and rooms within the university. This position ensures the system and component specific choices meet the scalability and operational effectiveness needs of UNT. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Information Technology Information Technology Staff Read more Senior Systems Integration Architect This position would support the purpose of solidifying the function of Integrated Systems and Development and Operations for UNT (DevOps). This job includes exercising a working knowledge of Development and Operations best practices for a team that utilizes tools such as application development (multi platform), web development, coding as infrastructure, SQL server and database bound applications, automation as operations. The primary focus of this manager will be Development. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Information Technology Information Technology Staff Read more Cross Functional IT Support Coordinator This position provides high level technical support for Faculty, Staff, Students, and Guests of UNT. Duties include maintaining, troubleshooting, and repairing A/V systems, digital signage systems, student/lab computers; responding to user requests for technology assistance, training, and support; providing technology support for campus events; assisting with other departmental services such as checking out equipment, installing software, responding to tickets, etc. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Information Technology Administrative/Office Support Information Technology Staff Read more Evening Facility Coordinator This position is responsible for assisting with the planning, conducting, managing, staffing and equipping of the Informal Recreation program within Recreational Sports. Additionally, this position supervises the evening operations in the Pohl Recreation Center and other auxiliary facilities. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Internship Specialist The Career Center Department at the University of North Texas is seeking to hire an Internship Coordinator to join our team. Position is responsible for organizing and managing internship programs and events for assigned colleges; provide internship programming to students interested in working as an intern, and work with faculty and staff in the colleges to provide support for their internship programs within their colleges; work with academic counselors on internship procedures, ensure that student internships are meeting departmental requirements and receiving credit for their internship; work with Internship Team to grow and expand Career Treks Job Shadowing program, work with students through classes, student organizations and individually to promote the services as they seek to make internship decisions; reach out to companies that recruit students from their assigned colleges and strengthen/start a recruiting relationship with companies; ensure that all activities of the office are assessed and reported. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more Hourly Writer, Editor & Research Specialist This position is to support the development of written works for communications and reporting within the Division of Student Affairs and externally to stakeholders and counterparts in the field. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Hourly Read more Sr Grant & Contract Acct Anlst The Sr Grants & Contracts Accounting Analyst position in the Grants & Contracts Administration unit (Post-Award team) is responsible for administering highly complex research grant awards and budgets to maintain fiscal compliance and to minimize University liability and legal/financial risk campus-wide. The position reviews and sets up highly complex awards, monitors them, prepares invoices, financial reports and performs the award close-out. Prepares documents for requests for information and audits. Interpret sponsor guidelines/stay abreast of federal/state policy changes for 100+ external sponsors with varying legal/financial requirements. Vital campus expert, mitigate risk campus-wide in high-risk areas. Develop/deliver complex campus-wide training, develop and implement internal reporting and analysis tools. Develop policies/internal controls. Manage special projects. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Research & Innovation Administrative/Office Support Research Administration Staff Read more Postdoctoral Research Associate - The Horn Lab within the Department of Biological Sciences and BioDiscovery Institute (BDI). The Horn Laboratory in The BioDiscovery Institute and Department of Biological Sciences at the University of North Texas is seeking to hire a highly motivated Postdoctoral Research Associate to join our team. Our lab broadly focuses on characterizing molecular processes and engineering lipid-based bioproducts in plant systems Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Postdoctoral Research Staff Read more Director of Communications, Marketing and Public Relations The College of Visual Arts and Design (CVAD) at the University of North Texas (UNT) is seeking a Director of Communications, Marketing and Public Relations to provide strategic leadership for college-level marketing, communications, and public relations. The Director develops and implements an integrated communications strategy that advances the college’s priorities, strengthens its visibility and reputation, and supports student recruitment, engagement, advancement, and community outreach.\nThe Director oversees CVAD communications across multiple platforms and formats, including the college website, social media, newsletters, press releases, advertising, donor and recruitment materials, publications, short-form video, and other print and digital content. The position creates and edits clear, compelling, and audience-focused communications and identifies opportunities to share the accomplishments and impact of CVAD students, faculty, staff, alumni, programs, and partners.\nWorking closely with UNT’s University Brand Strategy and Communications (UBSC), the Director ensures that CVAD communications align with university branding, communication standards, institutional priorities, and applicable policies. The position requires exceptional writing, editing, proofreading, project-management, and organizational skills, as well as the ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines.\nThe Director is responsible for ensuring that web, digital, print, and multimedia communications meet institutional policies and accessibility requirements, including ADA compliance. Additional responsibilities include cultivating media and campus relationships, researching marketing opportunities and best practices, supporting major college events and initiatives, and supervising student employees. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Advertising/Marketing Staff Read more Student Media Coordinator It is responsible for supporting multiple student media groups, including the Debate Team, Comm Future Pros, DCTV, Hatch, KNTU, NT Daily, NTTV, and Swoop. This position will perform or assist with a variety of administrative including (1) payroll processes; (2) purchases for student meetings and events; (3) requisition and invoice management; (4) reserve rooms for student media meetings; (5) working with faculty advisors and staff managers of various student media areas; (6) other duties as may be assigned. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Staff Read more Digital Accessibility Specialist The Digital Accessibility Specialist within the Office of Disability Access is a student-, faculty-, and staff-facing position focused on advancing digital accessibility across the University of North Texas. The Digital Accessibility Specialist works directly with students with disabilities and faculty to identify, troubleshoot, and resolve digital accessibility barriers that may impact a student’s access to course materials, instructional technologies, or participation in the academic experience. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Administrative/Office Support Student Services/Student Affairs Staff Read more UNT Retail Dining Services, Union Burger- Food Service Specialist The Food Service Specialist at Union Burger within UNT Retail Dining Services is responsible for delivering high-quality food and exceptional customer service in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment. This position supports daily operations by preparing and serving menu items, maintaining food safety and sanitation standards, and ensuring a clean and welcoming dining area for students, faculty, staff, and guests. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Food Services/Hospitality Staff Read more Strategic Communications Coordinator The Strategic Communications Coordinator supports the successful execution of communications initiatives across the Division of University Advancement by coordinating projects, maintaining departmental workflows, and helping ensure strategic priorities move efficiently from planning through completion. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Advancement Advancement/Development Staff Read more UNT Retail Dining Services, Union Burger - Food Service Supervisor The Food Service Supervisor for Union Burger at the University of North Texas -Retail Dining Services is responsible for overseeing daily restaurant operations, ensuring exceptional customer service, and maintaining high standards of food quality, safety, and cleanliness. This role provides hands-on leadership to team members, supports staff training and development, and ensures efficient workflow during all service periods. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Student Affairs Food Services/Hospitality Staff Read more Sr Student & Pgrm Coordinator The position coordinates various activities to recruit, retain, mentor students to support the mission and strategic plan of the academic program. Responsible for managing the daily operations of the program, including mass communications, publications, research and interacting with students and potential students. Supervises all administrative tasks related to strategic planning, travel logistics, and recruiting. This position is essential to providing high quality coaching and training, while nurturing the development of students. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Administrative/Office Support Research Administration Staff Read more Lecturer of Political Science and International Studies The faculty member will be expected to teach INST 2100 and advanced courses in political science and international studies, including courses in international security, national security, and area studies. with a preference for East Asian countries. Denton, Texas, United States UNT-Provost Faculty - Liberal Arts/Social Sciences Faculty Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 220 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 › 1155 Union Circle #311277, Denton, Tx 76203-5017 Phone: 855.878.7650 (option #2) HRemployment@untsystem.edu Quick Links Home View All System Jobs My Settings Applicant Login Equal Employment Opportunity | Notice of Nondiscrimination | Title IX | Workplace Posters Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept"
